251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A common problem with this step is that people want to assess everything and leave no stone unturned. It ends up taking many more weeks/months than needed and burns everyone out before the plan is even created. By adopting our simplicity principle to assessing your nonprofit, you can perform a rather quick assessment, engage the team, and still get the core themes on the table.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
